libvlc-wasm is licensed in two parts.

1. Everything written for this project -- the JavaScript SDK (packages/*/src,
   packages/*/index.js), the TypeScript types, the VLC modules and bridge in
   native/, the build scripts, tests, benchmarks and the player app -- is
   under the MIT License below.

2. The compiled engine (packages/core/wasm/libvlc.wasm and libvlc.js,
   packages/sout/wasm/*) links VLC and its dependencies, some of which are
   GPL (libdvdnav, libdvdread and others), so the binary as a whole is
   distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later: see
   COPYING. Its source is VLC at the commit in wasm/VLC_COMMIT, the patches
   in build/patches (which, as changes to VLC, are under VLC's own licenses)
   and this repository's build scripts.

The bundled Noto Sans font is under the SIL Open Font License (fonts/OFL.txt).

